# FRQ_SEQ  1.4   Format version 2023.06.03
#
#  Frequency sequence used for Kokee/Fortleza fringe test
#
#  Astronomical convention is used for band definition
#  For instance notation 2004.1 32.0 means the band
#  that covers range [2004.1, 2036.1] MHz
#
#  Last updated by L. Petrov on 2026.07.24_10:03:06
#
HDS_NAME  v01
MOD_NAME  k01
#
STATION KOKEE     KK  kk_01
STATION FORTLEZA  FT  ft_01
#
#w  Bnd Low_frq bandwidh Sub
#
BAND C  2200.0  16.0   dir
BAND C  2216.0  16.0   dir
BAND C  2232.0  16.0   dir
BAND C  2248.0  16.0   dir
BAND D  2264.0  16.0   dir
BAND D  2280.0  16.0   dir
#
BAND A  8416.4  16.0   dir
BAND A  8432.4  16.0   dir
BAND A  8480.4  16.0   dir
BAND A  8512.4  16.0   dir
BAND A  8544.4  16.0   dir
#
BAND B  8688.4  16.0   dir
BAND B  8720.4  16.0   dir
BAND B  8816.4  16.0   dir
BAND B  8864.4  16.0   dir
BAND B  8880.4  16.0   dir
#
#    bnd  lo    low_freq high_freq
#
RANGE C 6600.0  6600.0   7600.0
RANGE D 6600.0  6600.0   7600.0
RANGE A 7600.0  8100.0   8600.0
RANGE B 8100.0  8600.0   9100.0
